                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[b]Astoundingly beautiful game and honestly shaping up to be one of the absolute best games in the action-adventure genre that I've played in years![/b] They simply don't make them like this anymore, except that they do now! There's plenty of challenge in this title and will likely not make you dissapointed if you're looking for just that.\n\nHad originally intended to sit down with this for 30 minutes up to an hour on my first run but just couldn't let it go. Suddenly 8 hours had passed and the game is still enchanting. Once you get into this world you will want to explore every nook and cranny for goodies, and plenty of goodies there are!\n\nI will likely update this review down the road - right now I'm too busy with enjoying the game!",
